  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Pressed by He Lang Zi’s lightning flash giant wolf after Hui Feng Zi marks his true body with a green feather, Fang Yuan casts the immortal killer move Position Star Swap. Starlight covers him; only four illusion star bodies remain on the field until he recreates another and restores the maximum count. Paired with six illusion star bodies, the cast leaves Hui Feng Zi and He Lang Zi without a quick counter.",
      "chapters": [
        877
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_lang_zi",
        "char_hui_feng_zi",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "move_six_illusion_star_bodies"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "While Lang Ya blessed land fights Qin Bai Sheng, Fang Yuan’s pairing of six illusion star bodies with position star swap is held up as far better fighting wisdom than the land spirit’s disjointed casts. He also uses the pair to stall Hui Feng Zi and He Lang Zi when he cannot safely join that larger fight.",
      "chapters": [
        881
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pairing-and-cores",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_lang_ya_blessed_land",
        "char_qin_bai_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After the defense, he counts position star swap among the four star path immortal killer moves he can already run in battle, rotating Star Mark, Star Shoot, and Starlight as cores because he holds only those three star path Immortal Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        886
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pairing-and-cores",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_star_mark_immortal_gu",
        "gu_star_shoot_immortal_gu",
        "gu_starlight_immortal_gu",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Against Eastern Sea pursuers he splits with six illusion star bodies, then casts position star swap to shift his true body onto a far illusion and leave freely after a short counterattack.",
      "chapters": [
        896
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pairing-and-cores",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_eastern_sea"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Among the six star path immortal killer moves he later controls, he lists this one with star cloud grindstone, star snake rope, six illusion star bodies, star fire escape, and projected star thought.",
      "chapters": [
        899
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "pairing-and-cores",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    }
  ],
